# Keep these in Git:
# Source/       C++ source code
# Content/      Unreal assets (.uasset, .umap)
# Config/       project configuration
# Plugins/      plugin source and configuration
# Build/        build settings/resources that may be required by the project
# *.uproject    project descriptor
